  "answer": "This feature request has been filed before. PowerToys#48184 asks for automatic profiles that turn modules off while a game or heavy app runs, and turn them back on when it exits. PowerToys#29565 and PowerToys#42348 ask for the same thing. #29565 was closed as a duplicate of #20615, which I didn't read. In #42348 a maintainer said they would also like profiles like this, but none of the three tickets says it has been built. Until it is, you have a few options. Use the per-module 'Do not activate when Game Mode is on' option where a module has it, for example Find My Mouse, Quick Accent, FancyZones and Always On Top. Add games to a module's excluded-apps list. Or turn off the modules you don't need, or exit PowerToys, while you play. Add your use case or a thumbs-up to #48184 rather than opening a new ticket."
 },
